{"id":"pan","lemma":"pan","pos":"noun","rank":1005,"glosses":["bread (food made by baking cereal dough)","bun (such as the kind used on a hamburger or hot dog)","money, dough"],"ipa":"/ˈpan/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"panes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-pan.wav","formAudio":{"panes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-panes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Me gusta el pan.","en":"I like bread.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438170"},{"text":"Al volver de la escuela compré dos panes.","en":"I bought two loaves of bread on my way home from school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634060"},{"text":"¿Dónde está el pan?","en":"Where's the bread?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450561"},{"text":"¿Quién corta el pan?","en":"Who cut the bread?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410101"},{"text":"Aquel hombre comió pan.","en":"That man ate bread.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/107050"}]}